  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 404.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 404.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to establish standards, criteria, and procedures for underground injection to wells to prevent pollution and protect groundwater as specified in 40 CFR 144, 145, and 146.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wq 404) #9842, eff 12-23-10; ss by #12728, eff 3-1-19",
